  "frodhesOptimized": {
    "_about": "The optimized unified engine (settled-loop early exit of core 1; the engine of Default): the unified engine plus settled-loop.patch (machine.rs, periph.rs, fm1-soc lib.rs, fm1-web lib.rs). Current candidate: v5 (an adaptive hold-off that also counts calls that paid for lookups and skipped nothing, up to 255 calls); it supersedes v4 (patch f0c787c8..., wasm a0dacf3f..., which was 1.4 to 3.7 times slower on five packages whose core 1 computes with registers that never repeat; kept in audio-audit/unified-settled-loop-adaptive/v4-superseded/). The switch is off in every new boot; a front end turns it on with fm1_settled_loop(1) after a boot. Built by ci/engine/build.mjs --optimized into fm1_web_frodhes_optimized.wasm; the committed copy is site/emulator/fm1_web_frodhes_optimized.wasm.",
